        "name": "USN-4336-2",
        "description": "USN-4336-1 fixed several vulnerabilities in GNU binutils. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 16.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that GNU binutils contained a large number of security  issues. If a user or automated system were tricked into processing a  specially-crafted file, a remote attacker could cause GNU binutils to  crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly execute arbitrary  code.",
        "aliases": [
